@startuml

' **Sequence Diagram for Admin Viewing Logs**
actor Admin
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant LogController
participant Database

Admin -> Frontend: Anmod om logoversigt
Frontend -> Backend: Send forespørgsel
Backend -> LogController: Hent logdata
LogController -> Database: Hent logs
Database --> LogController: Returner logs
LogController --> Backend: Returner logoversigt
Backend --> Frontend: Send data
Frontend --> Admin: Vis logoversigt

Admin -> Frontend: Klik på specifik log
Frontend -> Backend: Anmod om logdetaljer
Backend -> LogController: Hent logdetaljer
LogController -> Database: Hent detaljer
Database --> LogController: Returner detaljer
LogController --> Backend: Returner data
Backend --> Frontend: Vis detaljer
Frontend --> Admin: Vis logdetaljer

@enduml